title: "MLGeo: Machine Learning in the Geosciences"
message: >-
  If you use this book — in teaching, in research, or as the basis of an
  adapted course — please cite it. Cite the archived version you actually
  used (each release has its own DOI); cite the concept DOI when you mean
  the book in general.
