repository-code: "https://github.com/geo-smart/mlgeo-book"
url: "https://geo-smart.github.io/mlgeo-book"
abstract: >-
  A curriculum book for Machine Learning in the Geosciences (ESS 469/569,
  University of Washington): open-source scientific computing, AI-ready
  geoscience data, classic machine learning, deep learning, reproducible
  workflows, and working with agentic AI in scientific practice. Published
  with full French and Spanish editions.
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - geosciences
  - deep learning
  - reproducibility
  - open education
  - curriculum
  - Python
  - PyTorch
license: CC-BY-4.0
